# UI consistency

- Reuse existing section components before creating new ones.
- Avoid creating multiple variations of the same UI pattern.
- Maintain consistent spacing, typography, and layout.
- Use shared components for **repeated** patterns — not for one-off static legal prose (see [`page-composition.mdc`](page-composition.mdc)).
- Keep visual consistency across all pages.
- Prefer semantic theme utilities / shared classes over one-off visual variants.
